    "chakka": {
      "schema": "ed-character/1",
      "meta": {
        "name": "Chakka",
        "race": "Ork",
        "description": "Ork Power, with no privilege, and a whole lot of fuckin' rage.",
        "portrait": "data/chakka.jpg",
        "age": 17,
        "weight": "120 kg",
        "sex": "Male",
        "height": "6'10",
        "skinTone": "Light Grey",
        "background": "[LIVE] Chakka drew his first breath in a kaer that was meant to keep its people safe — until slavers cracked it open and dragged them into the light. Torn from his family before he was old enough to hold their faces in memory, he was shackled aboard a Theran airship and sold into slavery. For two years he laboured under a Theran dwarf, swallowing his rage and biding his time. When fate finally left the door to freedom unguarded, Chakka threw himself through it with everything he had — and he has never once looked back.",
